'''David Hunterborough''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{Zone|Tangleburg}}. They introduce {{Skill|Hunting}}, keep track of {{Skill|Hunting}} Milestones, and grant the player {{Item|David's Cloak}}.

== Milestones ==
'''David Hunterborough''' offers several Milestones for {{Item|David's Cloak}}. These are for:

* Unlocking unique '''[[Attributes]]'''
* '''Syphoning {{Item|Attribute Shard}}s'''
* Hunting {{Red|'''Combat'''}} creatures
* Hunting {{Aqua|'''Water'''}} creatures
* Hunting {{Dark Green|'''Forest'''}} creatures
* '''Obtaining {{Item|Attribute Shard}}s''' from '''[[Huntraps]]'''
* '''Obtaining {{Item|Attribute Shard}}s''' from '''[[Salts]]'''

